1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000


2
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:28,032
This Monday crawls like poison gray,
The silent walls just scream away.

3
00:00:29,109 --> 00:00:42,663
My empty sheets can find no rest,
A ragged wound inside my chest.

4
00:00:44,995 --> 00:00:59,377
My shaking hand digs in the sheet,
I scratch the notes in crying rage.

5
00:01:00,023 --> 00:01:12,877
The thick black ink begins to bleed,
And carve my wounds upon the page.

6
00:01:17,457 --> 00:01:31,950
I see us naked in the lake,
Our bodies burning for our sake.

7
00:01:32,007 --> 00:01:45,032
Your fingernails inside my skin,
Now choked by all this dark within.

8
00:01:47,634 --> 00:02:02,528
My shaking hand digs in the sheet,
I scratch the notes in crying rage.

9
00:02:02,694 --> 00:02:15,096
The thick black ink begins to bleed,
And carve my wounds upon the page.

10
00:02:20,453 --> 00:02:34,758
The keys are cold, my throat is tight,
I scream our pain into the night.

11
00:02:34,854 --> 00:02:47,939
The Lion does not roar in pride,
But whispers, weeping at your side.

12
00:02:50,416 --> 00:03:04,952
My shaking hand digs in the sheet,
I scratch the notes in crying rage.

13
00:03:05,327 --> 00:03:17,455
The thick black ink begins to bleed,
And carve my wounds upon the page.

14
00:03:22,774 --> 00:03:37,523
The organ dies in silent space,
I press my fingers on my face.

15
00:03:37,610 --> 00:03:52,120
My ragged breath is all that stays,
To chase away these empty days.

